{"seq":2,"slug":"embedding-models","title":"嵌入模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/rag-and-retrieval/embedding-models","wordCount":673,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"嵌入模型\">嵌入模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>嵌入模型处在「文本 → 向量 → 相似度」这条链的中间，几个概念如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>稠密向量</strong>：嵌入模型把文本映射为固定维度的稠密向量，语义相近的文本在向量空间中距离更近。</li>\n<li><strong>向量维度</strong>：从 all-MiniLM 的 384 到 E5-mistral 的 4096，维度越高表达力越强、存储与检索成本也越大。</li>\n<li><strong>最大长度</strong>：模型能一次编码的 token 上限，从 256 到 32768 不等，必须与分块大小匹配。</li>\n<li><strong>归一化</strong>：嵌入归一化后，余弦相似度与点积完全等价，选哪种对检索结果没有影响。</li>\n<li><strong>相似度度量</strong>：余弦相似度、点积、L2 距离三种，选择依据是嵌入是否归一化、向量长度是否有意义。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选型时按三个轴权衡即可：<strong>语言覆盖、最大长度、部署成本</strong>——而「用同一个模型编码查询与文档」是不可协商的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"嵌入模型的作用\">嵌入模型的作用</h2><p>嵌入模型（Embedding Model）将文本转换为稠密向量，使得语义相似的文本在向量空间中距离更近。它是 RAG 系统中连接自然语言查询和向量检索的桥梁。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    T1[&quot;文本 A&quot;] --&gt; EM[&quot;嵌入模型&quot;]&#10;    T2[&quot;文本 B&quot;] --&gt; EM&#10;    EM --&gt; V1[&quot;向量 A&quot;]&#10;    EM --&gt; V2[&quot;向量 B&quot;]&#10;    V1 --&gt; SIM[&quot;计算相似度&quot;]&#10;    V2 --&gt; SIM&#10;    SIM --&gt; Score[&quot;相似度分数&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    T1[\"文本 A\"] --&gt; EM[\"嵌入模型\"]\n    T2[\"文本 B\"] --&gt; EM\n    EM --&gt; V1[\"向量 A\"]\n    EM --&gt; V2[\"向量 B\"]\n    V1 --&gt; SIM[\"计算相似度\"]\n    V2 --&gt; SIM\n    SIM --&gt; Score[\"相似度分数\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"主流嵌入模型对比\">主流嵌入模型对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>最大长度</th>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>开源</th>\n<th>MTEB 排名</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>text-embedding-3-large</td>\n<td>3072</td>\n<td>8191</td>\n<td>多语言</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>text-embedding-3-small</td>\n<td>1536</td>\n<td>8191</td>\n<td>多语言</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BGE-M3</td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>8192</td>\n<td>多语言</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BGE-large-zh</td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>512</td>\n<td>中文</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GTE-Qwen2</td>\n<td>1536</td>\n<td>32768</td>\n<td>多语言</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E5-mistral-7b</td>\n<td>4096</td>\n<td>32768</td>\n<td>多语言</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>all-MiniLM-L6-v2</td>\n<td>384</td>\n<td>256</td>\n<td>英文</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cohere embed-v3</td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>512</td>\n<td>多语言</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"sentence-transformers\">Sentence Transformers</h2><p>Sentence Transformers 是最流行的开源嵌入模型框架，基于 Hugging Face Transformers 构建：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sentence_transformers import SentenceTransformer&#10;&#10;model = SentenceTransformer(&#39;BAAI/bge-large-zh-v1.5&#39;)&#10;&#10;sentences = [&#10;    &quot;什么是机器学习？&quot;,&#10;    &quot;机器学习是人工智能的一个子领域&quot;,&#10;    &quot;今天天气怎么样？&quot;,&#10;    &quot;深度学习使用神经网络来学习数据表示&quot;,&#10;]&#10;&#10;embeddings = model.encode(sentences, normalize_embeddings=True)&#10;print(f&quot;嵌入形状: {embeddings.shape}&quot;)&#10;&#10;import numpy as np&#10;similarity_matrix = np.inner(embeddings, embeddings)&#10;print(&quot;\\n相似度矩阵:&quot;)&#10;for i, s1 in enumerate(sentences):&#10;    for j, s2 in enumerate(sentences):&#10;        if i &lt; j:&#10;            print(f&quot;  &#39;{s1[:15]}...&#39; vs &#39;{s2[:15]}...&#39;: {similarity_matrix[i][j]:.4f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sentence_transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SentenceTransformer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SentenceTransformer(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BAAI/bge-large-zh-v1.5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sentences </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"什么是机器学习？\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"机器学习是人工智能的一个子领域\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"今天天气怎么样？\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"深度学习使用神经网络来学习数据表示\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">embeddings </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.encode(sentences, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">normalize_embeddings</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"嵌入形状: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">embeddings.shape</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">similarity_matrix </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.inner(embeddings, embeddings)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">相似度矩阵:\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, s1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sentences):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j, s2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sentences):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"  '</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">s1[:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">...' vs '</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">s2[:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">...': </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">similarity_matrix[i][j]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"openai-embeddings\">OpenAI Embeddings</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# from openai import OpenAI&#10;# client = OpenAI()&#10;&#10;def get_openai_embedding(texts, model=&quot;text-embedding-3-small&quot;):&#10;    # response = client.embeddings.create(input=texts, model=model)&#10;    # return [item.embedding for item in response.data]&#10;    pass&#10;&#10;embedding_models = {&#10;    &quot;text-embedding-3-small&quot;: {&quot;dim&quot;: 1536, &quot;price_per_1M&quot;: 0.02},&#10;    &quot;text-embedding-3-large&quot;: {&quot;dim&quot;: 3072, &quot;price_per_1M&quot;: 0.13},&#10;    &quot;text-embedding-ada-002&quot;: {&quot;dim&quot;: 1536, &quot;price_per_1M&quot;: 0.10},&#10;}&#10;&#10;for name, info in embedding_models.items():&#10;    print(f&quot;{name}: 维度={info[&#39;dim&#39;]}, 价格=${info[&#39;price_per_1M&#39;]}/1M tokens&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># from openai import OpenAI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># client = OpenAI()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> get_openai_embedding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(texts, model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text-embedding-3-small\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # response = client.embeddings.create(input=texts, model=model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # return [item.embedding for item in response.data]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    pass</span></span>\n<sp