an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"   理由: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">info[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'理由'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>嵌入模型将文本映射为稠密向量，是 RAG 系统的语义理解核心。</li>\n<li>BGE-M3 和 GTE-Qwen2 是当前中文场景下的最佳开源选择。</li>\n<li>归一化嵌入下余弦相似度等价于点积，选择哪种对结果无影响。</li>\n<li>text-embedding-3 系列支持维度裁剪，适合在性能和存储之间灵活调整。</li>\n<li>选择嵌入模型需要综合考虑语言支持、最大长度、维度和部署成本。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"嵌入模型","id":"嵌入模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌入模型的作用","id":"嵌入模型的作用"},{"level":2,"text":"主流嵌入模型对比","id":"主流嵌入模型对比"},{"level":2,"text":"Sentence Transformers","id":"sentence-transformers"},{"level":2,"text":"OpenAI Embeddings","id":"openai-embeddings"},{"level":2,"text":"相似度度量","id":"相似度度量"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌入模型选择指南","id":"嵌入模型选择指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"向量数据库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/rag-and-retrieval/vector-databases"},"next":{"title":"RAG 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/rag-and-retrieval/rag-architecture"}}